{"reviews":[{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-0","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent brush!","x":"Excellent exfoliant brush. The brush cells are a little hard but do an excellent job. My skin is more soft I'm going to keep using it to see if my cellulite gone.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-1","r":2.0,"t":"Two Stars","x":"the plastic part sticking out with the bristles are very hard and uncomfortable on my skin.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-2","r":2.0,"t":"This brush arrived with bristles falling out, and is ...","x":"This brush arrived with bristles falling out, and is far too scratchy to use on most of my skin - and I've never thought of my skin being very sensitive before. It is usable when wet, but still not very soft. Body brushes, to my understanding, aren't supposed to hurt.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-3","r":4.0,"t":"Does a very good job","x":"Takes a man minute to get use too, but does the job well","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-4","r":5.0,"t":"Best of three","x":"I ordered three brands based on all the reviews about bristles falling out. This is the one I kept. The quality looks the best, assembled well, sturdy and not stinky, and only one bristle fell out when I tugged all over the brush where the other two shed like mad. The bristles are more densely packed on this one, too, which I'm sure helps. Other reviews suggest the bristles are overly sharp, and they are scratchy but I like that and I don't feel they're doing any damage. From past experience, i ","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-5","r":4.0,"t":"Overall great brush","x":"The brush arrived and had some loose bristles floating around in the package, so I thought shedding might be a problem for this brush.  It actually hasn't shed at all, and has been a great body brush - I've been using it for the past couple of weeks before jumping in the shower, and my skin feels incredibly smooth.  Not sure how to measure if I have better circulation or not, but overall, i like using the brush.  Only downside is that the hand-strap is a bit loose.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-6","r":4.0,"t":"Bristles don't fall out, except maybe a couple but ...","x":"Bristles don't fall out, except maybe a couple but it's expected. Wish the silicone bits were a tad shorter but that's just me wanting to scrub too aggressively, they prevent you from doing that I guess. A little wide and thus hard to do corners or bumps/indents (spine, knees) but still doable","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-7","r":5.0,"t":"Like this brush","x":"My last body brush had a short handle and while I liked it I wasn't totally happy with it.  This one doesn't have any handles, but it fits nicely in my hand and is easy to use.  I like the way it works on my skin- it feels good and my skin is softer when I use it regularly.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-8","r":3.0,"t":"Other than that i like the shape and feel of the brush which i ...","x":"I received this quickly.  Unfortunately, the first time i used it a large chunk  of the bristles came out.  Other than that i like the shape and feel of the brush which i use for detox baths","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-9","r":4.0,"t":"Great discovery!","x":"W hy dud i the so long to learn of the benefits of dry brushing? This brish is an excellent product. Superior quality; does the job, both dry & wet applications. Good value for the money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-10","r":4.0,"t":"Good choice","x":"Sturdy, effective, well-desgned, goid quality. The added brush/nobs provide more stimulation to the skin. As long as my husband doesn't once again mistake it for a cleaning brush...","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-11","r":4.0,"t":"Good choice","x":"Sturdy, effective, well-desgned, goid quality. The added brush/nobs provide more stimulation to the skin. As long as my husband doesn't once again mistake it for a cleaning brush...","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-12","r":5.0,"t":"Love this brush","x":"Love this brush! Very easy to handle. It massages as well as dry brushes. I haven't tried it wet yet ass I am planning to buy another for that. Highly recommended!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-13","r":5.0,"t":"A great scrub","x":"I haven\u2019t used it for long but in the time I have, it is great.  The firmer projections take a little getting use to but it feels wonderful overall.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-14","r":5.0,"t":"Fantastic product!","x":"Absolutely love this product! I bought my mom one after seeing the results on my own skin. Fast shipping &amp; great transaction.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-15","r":3.0,"t":"I thought I would try this for exfoliation. I ...","x":"I thought I would try this for exfoliation.  I much prefer the plastic scrunchy type.  This is only a preference of mine.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-16","r":5.0,"t":"I'm really liking it. I've been trying to drying ...","x":"I'm really liking it. I've been trying to drying brush about 2 to 3 minutes daily before showering. Highly effective","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great brush! I use it for dry brushing","x":"Great brush! I use it for dry brushing! Glad I upgraded! Had a few loose bristles but none came out during use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-18","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing Brush","x":"I love this brush! I've used it dry and wet and I love it. It definitely works and makes my skin look amazing.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-19","r":2.0,"t":"Great idea but the bristles are a little too soft ...","x":"Great idea but the bristles are a little too soft for me and they are not long enough to do anything good.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-20","r":5.0,"t":"This is a nice dry brush","x":"This is a nice dry brush, I havent use it wet. Dry is kind of hard in the skin but is just the first time.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-21","r":5.0,"t":"recommend","x":"Great brush, I love the texture and the use of it. Wonderful and definitely with recommend to others.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-22","r":5.0,"t":"feels great","x":"I just started using this brush - it really feels great on my face. Can't wait to see the results!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-23","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent bodly brush","x":"Excellent body brush, exfoliates my skin nicely. The brush is not rough and I love the handle.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01LMXWJOI-24","r":5.0,"t":"smooth","x":"Great brush, solid construction. I've only had it a week but my skin feels much smoother.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the brush effective, leaving their skin softer and doing a good job.","cites":[1,4,8,10,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers find the bristles too hard, scratchy, or uncomfortable on the skin.","cites":[1,2,3]},{"text":"Some reviewers report bristles falling out or shedding, though others say shedding was minimal or not a problem.","cites":[3,5,6,7,9]},{"text":"Reviewers praise the build quality, describing it as sturdy, well-assembled, and well-designed.","cites":[5,10,11,12]},{"text":"Reviewers find the brush easy to handle and use.","cites":[8,13]}]},"qa":[]}